MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

To prevent OutOfMemoryError crashes when loading or saving many or large
task XML files, this change enforces size limits on task persistence:
- Limits PersistableBundle usage to 2.5 MB per task.
- Limits total task file size to 5 MB.

These limits are checked during both save (TaskWriteQueueItem) and load
(restoreTasksForUserLocked) operations.

Bug: 464276781
Test: Manual verification (tests will be added in subsequent CL)
